    once per turn. (Quick Effect): You can destroy both 1 card you control and 1
    card on the field. If this card is destroyed by battle or card effect: You can
    activate this effect; Special Summon 1 "Destiny HERO" monster from your GY during
    the Standby Phase of the next turn.'
